@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### login first (any role for browsing; Technician/Manager/Admin to author)

### list published articles (default view for everyone)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles

### search (full-text over title, summary, content and tags)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?q=wifi

### paging (limit is clamped to 1-50, page to >= 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?page=2&limit=5

### staff can filter by status; Employees always see PUBLISHED only, whatever they pass
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?status=DRAFT

### filter by category (note: query param is "category", not "categoryId" —
### the create/edit body fields use "categoryId" instead, matching TicketAPI's
### create route, so don't mix the two up)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?category=PASTE_CATEGORY_ID

### my own articles, any status (Technician/Manager/Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/mine

### create a draft article (Technician/Manager/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "How to Reset Your Corporate Wi-Fi Password",
  "summary": "Step-by-step guide to resetting your Wi-Fi credentials from the self-service portal.",
  "content": "1. Go to the self-service portal...\n2. Click 'Reset Wi-Fi Password'...\n3. Follow the emailed link...",
  "categoryId": "PASTE_CATEGORY_ID",
  "tags": ["wifi", "network", "password"]
}

### fetch one article (by _id or publicId, e.g. KB-2026-00001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID

### edit a draft or published article (author, or manager/admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "Updated summary text"
}

### publish
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1
}

### archive (requires no note, but one can be added)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/archive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "superseded by a newer article",
  "version": 1
}

### restore an archived article back to draft
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1
}

### view audit history
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/history

### soft-delete (must be archived or draft first, not published)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID

### --- SECURE-CORE: negative cases ---

### publish without version -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### publish with a stale version -> 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles/PASTE_ARTICLE_ID/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 999 }

### paging clamp: limit=0 -> 20 (default), limit=500 -> 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?limit=500

### array filter is ignored -> still PUBLISHED only for an Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb-api/articles?status[]=DRAFT&status[]=ARCHIVED
